     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts ipccc-to-icd10</b></p><a name=\"ipccc-to-icd10\"> </a><a name=\"hcipccc-to-icd10\"> </a><p>Mapping de (non spécifié) vers <a href=\"ValueSet-ipccc-icd10-targets.html\">TAUSSIG — Cibles CIM-10 de la correspondance IPCCC</a></p><br/><p>Mapping de <a href=\"CodeSystem-ipccc.html\">IPCCC — International Paediatric and Congenital Cardiac Code (Long List v5.0, AEPC-derived) (version : 5.0)</a> to <code>http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10|2019-covid-expanded</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td colspan=\"3\"><b>Détails du concept source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td colspan=\"3\"><b>Détails du concept cible</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Codes</b> de <a href=\"CodeSystem-ipccc.html\" title=\"https://taussig/fhir/CodeSystem/ipccc|5.0\">IPCCC — International Paediatric and Congenital Cardiac Code (Long List v5.0, AEPC-derived)</a></td><td><b>ipccctoicd10#documentedkidneydisease</b></td><td/><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Codes</b> de http://hl7.org/fhir/sid/icd-10|2019-covid-expanded</td><td><b>ipccctoicd10#additionalcode</b></td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">01.01.01</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Tetralogy of Fallot</td><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Q21.3</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Tetralogy of Fallot</td><td/><td>Source AEPC 5.0, ligne 538 : code principal Q21.3.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">01.01.02</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Transposition of the great arteries with concordant atrioventricular connections and intact ventricular septum</td><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Q20.3</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Discordant ventriculoarterial connection</td><td/><td>Source AEPC 5.0, ligne 564 : code principal Q20.3.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">01.01.03</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Congenitally corrected transposition of great arteries (discordant atrioventricular &amp; ventriculo-arterial connections)</td><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Q20.5</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Discordant atrioventricular connection</td><td/><td>Source AEPC 5.0, ligne 566 : code principal Q20.5.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">01.01.04</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Double outlet right ventricle</td><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Q20.1</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Double outlet right ventricle</td><td/><td>Source AEPC 5.0, ligne 390 : code principal Q20.1.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">01.01.06</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Pulmonary atresia + ventricular septal defect (VSD) (including Fallot type)</td><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Q21.3</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Tetralogy of Fallot</td><td/><td>Source AEPC 5.0, ligne 541 : code principal Q21.3.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">01.01.07</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Pulmonary atresia with intact ventricular septum</td><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Q22.0</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Pulmonary valve atresia</td><td/><td>Source AEPC 5.0, ligne 588 : code principal Q22.0.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">01.01.09</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Hypoplastic left heart syndrome</td><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Q23.4</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Hypoplastic left heart syndrome</td><td/><td>Source AEPC 5.0, ligne 589 : code principal Q23.4.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">01.01.10</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Transposition of the great arteries with concordant atrioventricular connections and ventricular septal defect</td><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Q20.3</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Discordant ventriculoarterial connection</td><td/><td>Source AEPC 5.0, ligne 565 : code principal Q20.3.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">01.01.14</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Double inlet atrioventricular connection (double inlet ventricle)</td><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Q20.4</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Double inlet ventricle</td><td/><td>Source AEPC 5.0, ligne 348 : code principal Q20.4.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">01.01.16</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Partial anomalous pulmonary venous connection of Scimitar type</td><td/><td><a href=\"