t-width: 0px\">01.01.20</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Atrioventricular septal defect and Tetralogy of Fallot</td><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Q21.2</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Atrioventricular septal defect</td><td/><td>Source AEPC 5.0, ligne 539 : code principal Q21.2. Colonne additionnelle source : Q21.3. Ne constitue pas automatiquement un code CIM-10 : le référentiel et le contexte doivent être vérifiés.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">01.01.21</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Complex heart abnormality</td><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Q20.9</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Congenital malformation of cardiac chambers and connections, unspecified</td><td/><td>Source AEPC 5.0, ligne 38 : code principal Q20.9.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">01.01.22</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Functionally univentricular heart</td><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Q20.9</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Congenital malformation of cardiac chambers and connections, unspecified</td><td/><td>Source AEPC 5.0, ligne 579 : code principal Q20.9.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">01.01.23</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Double outlet right ventricle with doubly committed ventricular septal defect</td><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Q20.1</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Double outlet right ventricle</td><td/><td>Source AEPC 5.0, ligne 396 : code principal Q20.1.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">01.01.24</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Double outlet right ventricle with intact ventricular septum</td><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Q20.1</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Double outlet right ventricle</td><td/><td>Source AEPC 5.0, ligne 397 : code principal Q20.1.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">01.01.25</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Pulmonary atresia + ventricular septal defect (VSD) + systemic-to-pulmonary collateral artery(ies) (MAPCA(s))</td><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Q21.3</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Tetralogy of Fallot</td><td/><td>Source AEPC 5.0, ligne 543 : code principal Q21.3. Colonne additionnelle source : Q27.8. Ne constitue pas automatiquement un code CIM-10 : le référentiel et le contexte doivent être vérifiés.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">01.01.26</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Tetralogy of Fallot with pulmonary atresia</td><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Q21.3</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Tetralogy of Fallot</td><td/><td>Source AEPC 5.0, ligne 542 : code principal Q21.3.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">01.01.27</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Pulmonary atresia + ventricular septal defect (VSD): aorta from right ventricle</td><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Q21.3</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Tetralogy of Fallot</td><td/><td>Source AEPC 5.0, ligne 2040 : code principal Q21.3.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">01.01.28</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Pulmonary atresia + ventricular septal defect (VSD): aorta from left ventricle</td><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Q21.3</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Tetralogy of Fallot</td><td/><td>Source AEPC 5.0, ligne 2041 : code principal Q21.3.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">01.01.29</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Pulmonary atresia + virtually intact ventricular septum (tiny ventricular septal defect)</td><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Q22.0</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Pulmonary valve atresia</td><td/><td>Source AEPC 5.0, ligne 2043 : code principal Q22.0.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">01.01.30</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Congenital heart disease</td><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">Q24.9</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Congenital malformation of heart, unspecified</td><td/><td>Source AEPC 5.0, ligne 35 : code principal Q24.9.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">01.01.31</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Acyanotic congenital heart dise